CTWS bundles data from other projects. This file says which, and under what terms.

GeoNames geographical database — https://www.geonames.org/
  Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 (CC BY 4.0):
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
  Used: the cities of more than 15,000 people (`cities15000`), with the names of their
  first-level administrative divisions and countries, trimmed to name, region, country and
  population by `tools/cities/build-cities.mjs` and shipped as
  `apps/api/src/cities/cities.json`. It is what the Hometown and Lives in fields are checked
  against, so that a city is written one way rather than five.

